 "intro_zh": "张掖丹霞地貌分布广阔，主要分布在临泽、肃南两县，面积300多平方公里，是中国丹霞地貌发育造型最丰富的地区之一。其经典之处主要有七彩屏、火海、七彩塔、七彩练、七彩菇、大扇贝等。",
 "intro_en": "Zhangye Danxia landform is widely distributed, mainly distributed in Linze and Sunan counties, covering an area of ​​more than 300 square kilometers. It is one of the areas with the richest Danxia landforms in China. Its classic features mainly include colorful screen, sea of ​​fire, colorful tower, colorful drill, colorful mushrooms, large scallops, etc.",
